    {
      "section": "1.4.2",
      "label": "",
      "text": "The measured attributes (and associated errors) include location on the focal plane; a static point-source model ﬁt to world coordinates and ﬂux; a centroid and adaptive moments; and surface brightnesses through elliptical multiple apertures that are concentric, PSF-homogenized, and logarithmically spaced in intensity.",
      "id": null
    },
    {
      "section": "1.4.3",
      "label": "",
      "text": "The DMS shall create an Object Catalog, based on sources deblended based on knowledge of CoaddSource, DIASource, DIAObject, and SSObject Catalogs, after multi-epoch spatial association and characterization.",
      "id": "DMSR-2332"
    },
    {
      "section": "1.4.3.1",
      "label": "",
      "text": "The DMS shall compute a photometric redshift for all detected Objects.",
